Description: Standard metrics converter and comparator for consumer electronics.
    Provides utility functions for converting battery capacity (mAh to Wh),
    comparing wall charger output times, and validating product specifications
    using standard formulas. Includes a sample dataset of electronic accessories
    compiled from CairoVolt's catalog.
